        <mxCell id="git" value="halden-configs — private Git repository (config-as-code)&#10;&#10;Nightly export from DC01/DC02 (GPO, AD, DHCP, DNS, NPS) and from OPNsense/Linux (filtered config): scripts/06 and scripts/07. Commit message &quot;nightly: &lt;date&gt;&quot;.&#10;Drift check (scripts/08): a changed file with no approved change record in GLPI raises an &quot;unauthorised change&quot; High ticket. The diff is half the control; the change record is the other half." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontColor=#0f766e;" vertex="1" parent="1">
